---
// src/components/ca-bot/CaBotBenefits.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white w-full">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start mb-24">
      <!-- Why CA firms offer it -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#25D366]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          Why CA firms offer it
        </h2>
        
        <ul class="space-y-6">
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed">Frees your team from the same repeat questions.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed">Clients get answers after office hours, on their own.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed">Runs across all your clients at no per-client cost.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed">Gives clients a reason to stay with your firm.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#25D366]/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#25D366] rounded-full"></div></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-white font-bold leading-relaxed">Nothing new to learn. It's just WhatsApp.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Costs and Safety -->
      <div class="space-y-16">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
            What it costs
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 font-medium leading-relaxed bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
            <span class="text-[#25D366] font-bold">Nothing, for your firm or your clients.</span> <br/>No per-client charge, however many you connect.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
            Your clients' data stays safe
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
              <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">Read-only.</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">It answers questions, it never changes the books.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
              <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">Full control.</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">You pick which clients are connected, and can remove any at any time.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
              <span class="font-bold text-white block mb-1">Strict isolation.</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">Each client's data answers only their own questions. Never sold or shared.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
